<title>PHILIPPINES: Philippine Jan fiscal deficit at 3.392 bln pesos.</title>
<headline>Philippine Jan fiscal deficit at 3.392 bln pesos.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1997-02-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Philippines posted a fiscal deficit of 3.392 billion pesos in the first month of the year, against a 377 million peso surplus registered in the same period last year, the Department of Finance said on Monday.</p>
</text>
